# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Evaluated before static assets, so a rule here
# wins even when a file exists at the source path. Each spelling needs its own
# line: Pages matches the source exactly, so /engine does not cover /engine/.
#
# The engine page moved to the root. Old links, bookmarks and indexed URLs
# land on the same content, permanently.
/engine / 301
/engine/ / 301
/engine.html / 301
